h  unfortunately we were resorted to  standing at the end of the drive and  waving and um singing happy birthday  from a distance which was a real shame  and ironically there's probably nothing  that my my grandfather would have  enjoyed more than sitting in the garden  with a glass of wine and some cheese  with all of us the sadness the sacrifice  the sheer difficulty of life back in may  2020  brought into sharp focus by an image  that's angered many  becky johnson sky news
 

